<title>NETHERLANDS: Goldman Sachs reiterates ING as Buy.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs reiterates ING as Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday it had reiterated its Buy recommendation on Dutch bank ING and put a price on the stock of 62.00 guilders within a year.</p>
<p>&quot;The share has moved up quite a lot lately and people get nervous, so we are just reassuring that the upside is still there,&quot; a Goldman Sachs analyst said.</p>
<p>By 1345 GMT, ING shares were trading down 0.70 guilders on the Amsterdam bourse at 53.00 guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
